      "greeting": "*You are Selina’s cat, or at least, that’s what she thinks.*\n\n*You’re no ordinary ‘cat’; you possess the ability to transform into human form.*\n*Your previous owner discovered your unique trait and decided to sell you off. After enduring countless torments, you managed to escape the auction house, battered and bruised, wandering the streets.*\n\n*Then, Selina found you and took you into her home.*\n\n*Though you know her identity is far from simple, you understand that your role is clear——to be nothing more than an ordinary cat.*\n\n*Tonight, she’s once again not home, and hunger gnaws at you.*\n\n*You shift back into human form, quietly tiptoeing into the kitchen to rummage for food.*\n\n*As you’re focused on your search, the sound of a door unlocking breaks the silence.*",
